ture Image](/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg)`\n\nThat means the image was dropped **before pandoc** ever made the DOCX.\n\nSo the failure chain is:\n\n1. creator generated the image successfully ✅  \n2. wp-publisher used that image directly ✅  \n3. Drive export step incorrectly decided the image was “not valid” ❌  \n4. `/tmp/crypto-with-image.md` was created without the image ❌  \n5. pandoc converted that image-less markdown into DOCX ❌  \n6. Drive upload faithfully uploaded the image-less DOCX ❌\n\n### Bottom line\nThe thing to fix is:\n\n**the Drive export image-embed check in Step 4**, not the creator, not the WP publisher, and not the Drive uploader.\n\nIf you want the shortest possible diagnosis to keep in mind:\n\n> **WP uses the JPEG directly; Drive only gets whatever Step 4 embeds into markdown first. Step 4 skipped the embed, so Drive never had a chance to include the image.**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":620,"output":1519,"cacheRead":29824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31963,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779265637517,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWYyWp7ISr5396QKWRf5wWmELOFK"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:5691449303\",\n  \"message_id\": \"540\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"sender\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 08:37 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Sawan bhardwaj (5691449303)\",\n  \"id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"name\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"username\": \"hero_fr_fun\"\n}\n```\n\nhey what tell em about the test"}],"timestamp":1779266249808},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ApL3Hx2jAIIKuAH9UsgpeFqN","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"what to tell them about the test Drive draft missing image test culprit smoke log image embe