{"traceSchema":"openclaw-trajectory","schemaVersion":1,"traceId":"a16c6f35-d40b-4773-8998-8f495967c3d3","source":"runtime","type":"prompt.submitted","ts":"2026-05-20T08:38:55.325Z","seq":4,"sourceSeq":4,"sessionId":"a16c6f35-d40b-4773-8998-8f495967c3d3","sessionKey":"agent:orchestrator:telegram:direct:5691449303","runId":"c2ba1b8d-51d6-4cdd-8fc1-a75d191ab24a","workspaceDir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator","provider":"local-bifrost","modelId":"gpt-5.4","modelApi":"openai-completions","data":{"prompt":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:5691449303\",\n  \"message_id\": \"542\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"sender\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 08:38 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Sawan bhardwaj (5691449303)\",\n  \"id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"name\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"username\": \"hero_fr_fun\"\n}\n```\n\ndid you done the test or not can you continue the chain from the creator again to test it and go on to the drive link draft","systemPrompt":"You are a personal assistant running inside OpenClaw.\n## Tooling\nTool availability (filtered by policy):\nTool names are case-sensitive. Call tools exactly as listed.\n- read: Read file contents\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n- edit: Make precise edits to files\n- exec: Run shell commands (pty available for TTY-required CLIs)\n- process: Manage background exec sessions\n- web_search: Search the web (Brave API)\n- web_fetch: Fetch and extract readable content from a URL\n- browser: Control web browser\n- canvas: Present/eval/snapshot the Canvas\n- message: Send messages and channel actions\n- agents_list: List OpenClaw agent ids allowed for sessions_spawn when runtime=\"subagent\" (not ACP harness ids)\n- sessions_list: List other sessions (incl. sub-agents) with filters/last\n- sessions_history: Fetch history for another session/sub-agent\n- sessions_send: Send a message to ano