h into the crypto system. That language is important because it tells traders and operators where enforcement pressure is moving."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779265231472},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"calldUUC4p14OFieTtPvjPPzHKgq","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"crypto news pipeline Google Drive draft image missing feature image reason symlink","maxResults":5,"minScore":0.2}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1060,"output":863,"cacheRead":26496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28419,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779265231478,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWSMIsc71Y2wv1wr89PUoZvf6L1s"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"calldUUC4p14OFieTtPvjPPzHKgq","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"273f05bac64d12dbf2a2ee1fe6713d2ada6465e6a507d57c9e57e98256b47930\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-05-16-publish-status.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 142,\n      \"endLine\": 156,\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"textScore\": 0.706652402346214,\n      \"snippet\": \"m◒[39m [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◐[39m [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[32m◇[39m [?25h [2KRunning the upload command now and I’ll pull out the `webViewLink`. The upload is still running; I’m checking for the JSON result now. https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XRunsjpbpKL463JcxLqpSreX7WqX6FaN/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=109667066179998081561&rtpof=true&sd=true\\n\\nContinue the task if needed, then reply to the user in a helpful way.\\nIf it succeeded, share the relevant output.\\nIf it failed, explain what went wrong.\\nassistant: [[reply_to_current]] ✅ Crypto News Pipeline Complete!\\n\\n📰 Article: CLARITY Act clears 15-9 vote as Bitcoin hits $82K and crypto stocks jump\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-05-16-publish-status.md#L142-L156\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n    